    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/15-father-dominic-road-ballyphehane-cork-t12-d8v0-1\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 15 Father Dominic Road, Ballyphehane, Cork.\r\n\r\nSituated in an established residential area, this charming two-bedroom semi-detached home offers approximately 67 m² of practical accommodation. The traditional façade is complemented by a gravelled front garden, planted borders and a pathway leading to the entrance.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, the ground floor opens into a welcoming hallway with access to the main living spaces. The living room is a comfortable and inviting space, featuring a fireplace and a large front-facing window that provides good natural light. To the rear, the fitted kitchen offers practical cabinetry and countertop space, together with an adjoining dining area suitable for everyday meals. A door from the kitchen provides direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property comprises two well-proportioned bedrooms, both benefiting from natural light and offering flexibility for sleeping accommodation, storage or home-working requirements. The bathroom is arranged as a shower room and includes an enclosed shower, WC and wash-hand basin.\r\n\r\nOutside, the generous enclosed rear garden features a lawn, paved and gravelled seating areas, and a variety of established plants. Gated side access provides a convenient route between the front and rear of the property. A large steel shed is currently arranged as a home gym, while a separate utility and storage area provides further practical space.\r\n\r\nThe property is conveniently positioned close to The Lough and Virgin Media Park. Local schools, shops, recreational facilities and bus services are also within easy reach, providing convenient access to Cork City and the surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nWith its practical two-bedroom layout, generous garden and useful outdoor facilities, this home offers an attractive opportunity in Ballyphehane. Its combination of comfortable living space and convenient location makes it an appealing choice for a range of purchasers."
      },
